  "vendor_website": "treetech.com.br",
  "description": "Communication module for tap position units: tap position, mode and synchronism status of up to 18 SPS units and six banks or transformers",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-10",
  "firmware": "2.9 R12",
  "source": "Treetech COMM04 Mapa de Protocolos de Comunicação MAP-022, rev. 1.00",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "COMM04: Mapa de Protocolos de Comunicação (MAP-022, planilha)",
      "version": "1.00",
      "date": "2023-01-03",
      "url": "https://sac.treetech.com.br/helpdesk/attachments/69130813877",
      "note": "sheet Full Map (Modbus); linked in issue #157"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU on RS-485, FC03 and FC06 only. Addresses are 0-based, as sent on the wire. The document lists every register as a holding register.",
    "Baud rate is selectable (4800 to 115200 bit/s), 8 data bits, no parity, 1 or 2 stop bits (detected automatically). The document gives no factory default for the baud rate or the address; 9600 and 1 are assumed here.",
    "The device collects tap position and operating mode from up to 18 SPS tap position units and six banks or transformers. Status words are bit fields, one entry per bit. Registers 69 to 71 are not in the document. The document does not say which registers can be written; all are listed as read-only here.",
    "The bank or transformer blocks (registers 56 to 67) use a different bit layout from the SPS blocks (registers 2 to 55).",
    "The document applies to firmware 2.9 R12. Written from that document; this map has not been tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "baudrate": 9600,
  "parity": "N",
  "databits": 8,
  "stopbits": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
  "enums": {
    "yesno": {"0": "No", "1": "Yes"},
    "triggered": {"0": "Not triggered", "1": "Triggered"},
    "remote_local": {"0": "Local", "1": "Remote"},
    "man_auto": {"0": "Manual", "1": "Automatic"},
    "phase_bank": {"0": "Individual phase", "1": "Bank"},
    "phases": {"0": "Three-phase", "1": "Single-phase"},
    "ready": {"0": "Not ready", "1": "Ready"}
  },
